@startuml

salt
{
  <b>CURVE OR SURFACE: oresmd://ir/USD?type=series&instrument=ir_swap</b> | [ Back to market data ]
  --
  {#
    Series | Value
    Subclass | yield
    Asset classes | IR, Rates
    Derivation | IR_CURVE_BOOTSTRAP (config ...a41f, v3)
  }
  {
    Show | ^One instant^ | ^A range^
    As of | "2026-10-06 14:00"
    Step | ^30 minutes^ | Span | ^6 hours^ | [ Apply ]
  }
  --
  <b>ALIGNED VIEW</b> | values are read unaligned and as text; the browser aligns them by node
  {#
    Node | 12:00 | 12:30 | 13:00 | 13:30 | 14:00
    fwd_start=0D&tenor=3M | 4.121 | 4.118 | 4.130 | 4.127 | 4.131
    fwd_start=0D&tenor=6M | 4.204 | 4.199 | 4.211 | 4.209 | 4.214
    fwd_start=0D&tenor=1Y | 4.301 | 4.295 | 4.310 | 4.306 | 4.312
    fwd_start=0D&tenor=2Y | . | . | 4.402 | 4.398 | 4.405
  }
  --
  <b>ADDED AND DROPPED NODES</b> | 12:00 against 14:00
  {#
    Node | Change | From | To
    fwd_start=0D&tenor=2Y | added | (absent) | 4.405
    fwd_start=0D&tenor=9M | dropped | 4.260 | (absent)
  }
  --
  <b>COMPARE TWO INSTANTS</b> | ^12:00^ vs ^14:00^
  {#
    Node | Value A | Value B | Difference
    fwd_start=0D&tenor=3M | 4.121 | 4.131 | +0.010
    fwd_start=0D&tenor=6M | 4.204 | 4.214 | +0.010
  }
  --
  The reads carry an oresmd URI and end at now. There is no time range and no
  set of instants; the shape is not declared, so a hole in a bucket cannot be
  told from a node that is not part of the curve. See the journey's What is
  missing.
}

@enduml
